{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4wfSQ5fR7RrbhgLDPG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before a simple, weathered door. Its surface is plain wood, scarred by time. There is a single keyhole, tarnished brass, centered beneath a handle worn smooth by countless hands.*\n\n*A faint draft breathes through the keyhole. Cold. Carrying the scent of something forgotten.*\n\n*The keyhole watches you like an eye.*\n\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀┌──────────────┐\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀│⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀│\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀│⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀│\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀│⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀│\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀│⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀🔑⠀│\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀│⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀│\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀│⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀│\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀│⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀│\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀└──────────────┘\n\n*Do you have the key?*\n\n*Do you know which one it needs?*\n\n*...Do you know what's on the other side?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":623,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}